# spa/ is the mirror of web/build written by web/scripts/sync-embed.mjs. It is
# build output and is never committed — but the directory itself must exist and
# be tracked, or `//go:embed all:spa` fails to compile in a fresh clone and
# `go test ./...` breaks for everyone who has not run `make web-build` yet.
#
# So: ignore everything in spa/, keep the one empty marker file.
spa/*
!spa/.gitkeep
